<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh bourses closed for bank holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh bourses closed for bank holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's bourses - the main Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) and the Chittagong Stock Exchange - were closed on Tuesday for a bank holiday marking the beginning of the 1997/98 fiscal year.</p>
<p>The DSE all-share price index fell 16.94 points or 1.5 percent to 1,111.55 at the close of trading on Monday. The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
